[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8901.27, "timestamp": "02:28:21", "text": "然後這裡還有一些很酷的東西，像是它還會給你時間碼，這很棒，我不明白"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8910.55, "timestamp": "02:28:30", "text": "他用的這個塊系統，它會在這個版本的這個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8919.429, "timestamp": "02:28:39", "text": "東西裡。  是的。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8923.51, "timestamp": "02:28:43", "text": "，是的。這是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8926.87, "timestamp": "02:28:46", "text": "影片。是的。  是的。是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8928.71, "timestamp": "02:28:48", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8937.11, "timestamp": "02:28:57", "text": "所以我想，他的影片應該放在這裡。是的，他只花了"}]